<tr>
    <td><b>Version management</b></td>
    <td>Version information</td>
    <td colspan="2">
        <div>
        NCPT content is reviewed on an ongoing basis by the NCPT Committee and republished annually or as needed as a new electronic Nutrition Care Process Terminology (eNCPT) edition (e.g., e2020, e2023). Edition-to-edition additions, revisions, and inactivations are tracked and published as part of each release.
        </div>
    </td>
